OL,3,AHacks star Jean Smart wins eighth Emmy
OL,4,Atying record for most acting wins
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaw & Order star Mariska Hargitay hosts
OL,7,FTV's biggest night, the 78th Primetime
OL,8,FEmmy Awards, and opens the show with a
OL,9,Fcelebrity-filled musical number
OL,11,FStars including Zendaya and Nicole
OL,12,FKidman to Colman Domingo and Matthew
OL,13,FRhys turn heads on the red carpet at
OL,14,Fthe Peacock Theater in Downtown Los
OL,15,FAngeles. See all the looks here
OL,17,FLeading the pack in nominations is
OL,18,Fmedical drama The Pitt, which is up for
OL,19,F25 awards - read more about the show
OL,20,Fhere
